#: scenario7:scenario7_2B1306B5_E4DA_499A_A661_6936ECC0D8BB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b04b376cae8d8eeac1aec7c7a9a60e15488a534cb998dd527c41791d226a40c4
