msgid "⟪k:0⟫but it would seem my will is not as absolute as I had thought."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫mais il semblerait que ma volonté ne soit pas aussi absolue que je ne l’aurais cru."

#: scenario7:scenario7_693D17D2_4D59_444F_8262_01C1D36A1DE5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c5c7624dec130bb2e4ab6c00655690ed62b6ee23fa310365f2c60afb67cd92e4
#. default-sha256: 31dc15fc23142118ea99ecc070c86f22c72baf14a767720cdd0389d1056292d0
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_693D17D2_4D59_444F_8262_01C1D36A1DE5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫What would you call that—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫the “power of love”?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Is ⟪k:5⟫that⟪k:6⟫ what "
"allowed this to happen?⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫How trite. ⟪k:9⟫Where’s the magic—⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫the ⟪k:12⟫"
"miracle⟪k:13⟫?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Comment appelle-t-on cela —⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ le « pouvoir de l’amour » ?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫C’est ⟪k:5⟫"
"ça⟪k:6⟫ qui a fait tout dérailler ?⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Quelle banalité. ⟪k:9⟫Où est passée la magie —⟪k:10⟫"
"⟪k:11⟫ le ⟪k:12⟫miracle⟪k:13⟫ ?"

