#: scenario7:scenario7_850595D6_C0F9_4F1D_8BCA_0C908B221FF2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e1f3bfa25833e01ec90883cdaba4056a9f33ffaa368370003ec583e755c393d8
