msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The air around the door has a distinct chill to it as I place my hand against the wood "
"surface."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫L’atmosphère qui entoure la porte est glaçante tandis que je pose la main contre la "
