#: scenario7:scenario7_29672F16_4DBB_4F6D_B257_2FF5F887FC83
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ff4d15756d6add73e99bd8d8558ca3aee375624838d8c8098f13ce284a995675
