msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It was my despair that brought you back to life,⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫so that makes it my "
"responsibility to end this."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫C’est mon désespoir qui t’a ramenée à la vie,⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫il en va donc de ma "
"responsabilité d’y mettre un terme."

#: scenario7:scenario7_188E107A_EF3F_47B9_9407_8F30878DA631
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 66c11a0baedb6be00262f7c43d10537dee9ddd11cee04196f9425034a637757f
