msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_188E107A_EF3F_47B9_9407_8F30878DA631"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫My own wish has given me all the redemption I need, my dear."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Mon vœu m’a déjà accordé toute la rédemption dont j’ai besoin, très cher."

#: scenario7:scenario7_051B510A_5B96_452C_B28C_FBC1D968A802
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7d503f34000dcef79d83278e5fa8450697972eac73156a3a8deb5c2331668eb5
#. default-sha256: f1d4dda4f7ec273882878c7bb3f7b64f07ca45a9c00b1529f1213d1e35046921
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_051B510A_5B96_452C_B28C_FBC1D968A802"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Or should I be expecting another self-righteous lecture about how “hatred does you no "
"good”?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Dois-je m’attendre à subir un autre de tes sermons bien-pensants selon lesquels « la "
"haine n’aide en rien » ?"

#: scenario7:scenario7_630BD0DE_F90E_44A7_9299_190B684C612D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 24b983dce62fc3bac5f593154733c0ae246e47f2d7ce3431f6fe4991f9267165
#. default-sha256: 9dc3b2f1ff9ed8b9f3b380ee1123a873f4e098a48192dbb2352da531c5e2b2c8
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_630BD0DE_F90E_44A7_9299_190B684C612D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Brilliant, Michel. Brilliant.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Do you have any idea how absurdly presumptuous "
"you’re being?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Trying to force your idea of redemption onto someone who has no interest "
"in it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Génial, Michel. Génial.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Sais-tu au moins à quel point tu te montres "
"prétentieux ?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫En essayant d’imposer ton idée de la rédemption à quelqu’un qui n’est pas "
"du tout intéressé ?"

#: scenario7:scenario7_01448503_32F6_4FF0_8033_3BB6C8C239FF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3b35568bea59e2ebd44178dcac65032f4bc2c11ed50dca7865271edb9ecb7710
#. default-sha256: 9159afbaf221ab27f6ad1a02e1658a3f0497337382c998f991aed004c8b95c05
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_01448503_32F6_4FF0_8033_3BB6C8C239FF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫If the tale you showed me was the whole truth..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Si le conte que tu m’as raconté est entièrement vrai..."

#: scenario7:scenario7_D7064C1C_1266_459D_9946_229AE6683B85
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a6c8e60a7c1f031b514935d8fb8ab46bf414e75ac7f8f1e0f70865e6e46faa08
#. default-sha256: 5a3d100a93394d54c5bf3ed49fa968efba27be0e3c96bac260f8deb50d986747
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_D7064C1C_1266_459D_9946_229AE6683B85"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫then I would have said you could revile those heartless men as much as you pleased."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫...alors je dirai que tu pourras avilir ces hommes cruels autant qu’il te plaira."

#: scenario7:scenario7_80AEDE1A_E079_4F43_BF1F_DC7B5D439794
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bad958372c76aacdcf517d9f63737944185500b1003921f4cc59ed92543a8100
#. default-sha256: 2c33c76ae39b46f5ce2f514f83f8baf545008c6d7109b4440be94fef5a47c8ab
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_80AEDE1A_E079_4F43_BF1F_DC7B5D439794"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But I refuse to believe that’s the whole story.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The men I saw beyond the first "
"three doors had genuine concerns and worries."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mais je refuse de croire que c’est là toute la vérité.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Les hommes que j’ai vus "
"derrière les trois premières portes avaient des préoccupations sincères."

#: scenario7:scenario7_FFCB0458_489F_4DF1_AEF5_B943A99AE731
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b8700f7c896b548f115913b28cf7cf8b81bf090a3647918e50a54641fdc2d8b7
#. default-sha256: 71e2ddc85d3977193141bb7ed091ceb5e68d7557b43dbdcbd66f109c7b8f7ae2
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_FFCB0458_489F_4DF1_AEF5_B943A99AE731"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫They felt things—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫real, human emotions—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫even if those things ultimately "
"led them down a path of destruction."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ils ressentaient des choses —⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ de vraies émotions, humaines —⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫ même si au "
"bout du compte elles les ont menés à leur perte."

#: scenario7:scenario7_CEC94C5E_2B7D_4088_BCB5_CE4948592495
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3201b318964b8168178a23af85205990c425167a1b2f31c54177ab30eabda15b
#. default-sha256: a645427527aa58505cab806384aed9c27d9b81878d413c38d01f5c40afee5ccb
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_CEC94C5E_2B7D_4088_BCB5_CE4948592495"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Wanting to do something nice for the one you care about,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫being disgusted at things "
"you’ve done,⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫hiding your urges from those around you."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫À⟪k:2⟫ vouloir faire quelque chose de gentil pour la personne qu’on aime,⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫à "
"être dégoûté par les choses qu’on a faites,⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫à cacher ses pulsions à ceux qui nous "
"entourent."

#: scenario7:scenario7_6336FA3F_666E_4FAA_A8C4_DF72B409FE8B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 813fd3e2f1c75aa8c92c17ac0aaa84c218070dc66d04fa9577e4e89521c63169
#. default-sha256: 3ea1eceafea6488981ac2bb2765136ef0b76b06a819ca8c11ba8be0bda51bb14
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_6336FA3F_666E_4FAA_A8C4_DF72B409FE8B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You certainly couldn’t call them ⟪k:1⟫good⟪k:2⟫ men,⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫but they were real people with "
"real conflicts."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫On ne peut certainement pas dire d’eux que c’étaient des hommes ⟪k:1⟫bons⟪k:2⟫,⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"non, c’étaient de vraies personnes avec de vrais dilemmes."

#: scenario7:scenario7_820226CB_A379_4EDB_AC2C_5046718D471D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 59b5e144ba1eeb50830069776303dec31988eb71596295a825e3161aa34249bb
