msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫That doesn’t change what happened. ⟪k:2⟫That two-faced young man deceived me, the beast "
"severed my arm,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Cela ne change pas ce qui est arrivé. ⟪k:2⟫Ce jeune homme hypocrite m’a trompée, la "
"bête m’a coupé le bras,"

#: scenario7:scenario7_3E6B0522_07E8_4613_8A05_B60AA2C61F44
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
