msgid "⟪k:0⟫and the greedy, power-hungry lord used me for his own personal gain."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫et le seigneur cupide, avide de pouvoir, a abusé de moi pour son profit personnel."

#: scenario7:scenario7_6BC69931_8297_49C0_A574_2FF84970AB3F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fb8eeecb3637ce6438077952649d8e50ef290edf818dc7513b32f915c223ca2d
